        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions 828/1/18 Decorative Door Handle</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThis very decorative door  handle is 18-1/2\" long and assembled in the USA by the master craftsmen at First Impressions. Available in your choice of Oil Rubbed Bronze, Antique Brass, Satin Nickel or Polished Brass.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThis Victorian design door pull is reminiscent of the late 1800's, very elaborate yet graceful, that embellished the european homes of the noble and wealthy. Can be used on metal, glass, composite or wood doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of First Impressions 828/1/18 Decorative Door Handle \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Handle Length: 18-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 16-5/8\" C/C</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Handle Diameter (at center): 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Projection: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Rosette Diameter: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Available Standard Finishes: 4</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This decorative door handle is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
